
## 1.0.24 — Multi-Language Live Channels

### Quick-start language playlists (iptv-org engine)
- NEW: `src/services/iptvService.js` — curated catalog of iptv-org language
  playlists (English, Español, Français, Deutsch, ???, News) plus a shared
  `importLanguageFeed(url)` helper that reuses the exact engine the IPTV page
  already uses to fetch, parse, dedupe scrub, and persist a playlist.
- NEW: Language chip bar on the Live Channels page — one tap imports that
  language's entire channel shelf through the proven engine, refreshes the grid,
  and flags the chip busy while it runs.
- IMPROVED: Language playlists reuse existing M3U parsing, adult-content safety,
  favorites, and HLS live detection — no new custom parser duplicated.

## 1.0.24

